Follow AGENTS.md and the accepted action. Verify physical repository, UUID,
lane, configured runtime and selected Git/Muse authority. Use the bound launcher.
Start and finish with `ok next`; canonical docs/NEXT.md is the only action source.
Use shared services for status, review, checkpoints, ledger and governance.
Keep ROADMAP and HANDOVER paired. Publish successors only through next-write
with current revision and whole-file expected digest. Preserve unrelated settings,
lanes, living files and other repositories. Never execute legacy_main.
Local implementation, remote transport and release/deployment are separate scopes.
Use configured review gates when applicable; do not invent extra review cycles or
claim independent review from author tests. No legacy live export or packet,
OCI, identity-bridge, native GSR or sole-writer prerequisite is implied.
